#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:49 index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kapp; is a computerized version of a well known strategy game. Commercial "
"and other Free Software versions exist but I (Gaël de Chalendar) created "
"this game initialy as a C++ learning exercise and so, I developped it up to "
"this point (see README for details)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54 index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the current version, &kapp; is a multi-player network-enabled game with "
"an AI. (see TODO for details)"
msgstr ""

