"Preliminary note : the map can be scrolled by three methods. First, you can "
"put your mouse near a border of the window and the map will scroll in that "
"direction. Second, you can use your mouse wheel: with no modifier, it will "
"scroll verticaly; when pressing the Meta key, it will scroll horizontaly. "
"And lastly, you can use the keyboard arrows."
