msgid ""
"If you hit, New Game, you will be presented with the New game dialog where "
"you will chose the number of players, the skin (or theme) to use, the game "
"type (conquer the goal or have a specific goal) and finally if this game "
"will be played with online players or if it is purely local."
msgstr ""

